Privacy
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

LumiLib reads the local Minecraft session only to display your account name,
skin head and whether you are signed in with a Microsoft account. The session
access token is never displayed, logged, stored or transmitted.

LumiLib makes no network requests of its own.

The account block can be turned off entirely in LumiLib's settings.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Acknowledgements
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

LumiLib is an independent implementation written against Minecraft 1.21.11.
No source code from any other project was copied or adapted.

The idea of a single hub screen for a set of mods, and of letting server
owners switch client mod features off, is not original to this project;
WalksyLib does the same. The implementation here is our own.
